---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import StatBadge from "../components/StatBadge.astro";
import { CONTACT } from "../data/site";
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 to-white">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">
    <div data-reveal="up">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">
        <Icon name="lucide:zap" class="mr-1 inline h-4 w-4 -translate-y-0.5" />
        7/24 Moto Kurye Hizmeti
      </span>
      <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">
        İstanbul'da Hızlı ve Güvenli <span class="gradient-text">Kurye Hizmeti</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        Evrak, dosya ve paket taşımacılığında Adalar dahil tüm İstanbul'a aynı gün teslimat.
        Hukuk ofisleri, şirketler ve kurumsal firmalar için özel kurye çözümleri.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <a href={`tel:${CONTACT.phoneTel}`} class="btn-primary">
          <Icon name="lucide:phone-call" class="h-5 w-5" />
          Hemen Ara: {CONTACT.phoneDisplay}
        </a>
        <a href="/#iletisim" class="btn-secondary">
          <Icon name="lucide:send" class="h-5 w-5" />
          Teklif Al
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-8">
        <StatBadge value="7/24" label="Kesintisiz Hizmet" />
        <StatBadge value="39" label="İlçeye Teslimat" />
        <StatBadge value="30 dk" label="Express Teslimat" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative" data-reveal="right" style="--reveal-delay: 150ms">
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/60">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white">
            <Icon name="lucide:route" class="h-6 w-6" />
          </span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">3 Adımda Kurye</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Basit ve hızlı süreç</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ol class="mt-6 space-y-5">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-slate-700">
            <span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-50 text-xs font-bold text-orange-600">1</span>
            <span>Arayın veya WhatsApp'tan yazın, siparişiniz saniyeler içinde alınsın.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-slate-700">
            <span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-50 text-xs font-bold text-orange-600">2</span>
            <span>En yakın kuryemiz, ortalama 30-90 dakika içinde adresinize ulaşır.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-slate-700">
            <span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-50 text-xs font-bold text-orange-600">3</span>
            <span>Teslim edildiğinde SMS veya WhatsApp'tan anında haber alırsınız.</span>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
